1
00:00:00,290 --> 00:00:02,300
Mobile charger garam kyun hota hai?

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:07,220
Kyunki har baar plug lagate hi yeh 230 volt se lad raha hota hai. Kaise?

3
00:00:07,220 --> 00:00:09,680
Ghar ke socket mein 230 volt aata hai.

4
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:12,290
Par aapke phone ko itni bijli nahi chahiye.

5
00:00:12,290 --> 00:00:15,160
Use bas thodi si chahiye, jaise 5 volt.

6
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:18,430
Toh charger ka kaam hai is badi bijli ko chhota karna.

7
00:00:18,430 --> 00:00:21,080
Par yeh kaam 100% perfect nahi hota.

8
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:24,720
Jo bijli kaam nahi aati, woh garmi ban ke bahar nikalti hai.

9
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:26,640
Isliye charger garam hota hai.

10
00:00:26,640 --> 00:00:31,480
Aur fast charger zyada garam hota hai, kyunki woh kam time mein zyada bijli bhejta hai.

11
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:33,200
Halka garam hona normal hai.

12
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:38,340
Par agar charger chhoone mein bahut garam ho, ya jalne ki smell aaye, toh turant nikaal do.

13
00:00:38,340 --> 00:00:41,290
Aur hamesha achhe, original charger use karo.

14
00:00:41,290 --> 00:00:45,640
Aise roz ke "kyun" ke liye Whysplained ko subscribe karo!
